#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.MATERIAL_MODIFIERS.TOOLTIP.EFFECTS_HEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.MATERIAL_MODIFIERS.TOOLTIP.EFFECTS_HEADER"
msgid "Buildings constructed from this material will have these properties"
